  "writingModel": [
    "In this text, I want to describe the most important things in my room and in my bag at WKU university. I use these things every day for studying, sleeping, and relaxing. Some of these objects are new and some are special gifts from my family.",
    "This is my laptop. It is a silver ASUS laptop and it is two years old. I use it for watching online lectures, writing essays, video calls with my family, and studying English. This laptop is the most important thing in my room. Without it, studying at university would be impossible for me.",
    "These are my textbooks on the shelf above my desk. I have six textbooks this semester. That big red book is my English textbook — it is my favourite! Those small blue books are my notebooks. I have one notebook for each subject. I write all my notes in these notebooks.",
    "This is my phone. It is a Samsung smartphone with a blue case. I use it to call my parents, set my alarm, take photos, and listen to music. That phone charger on my desk is very important — I never leave my room without it! My phone and laptop are my two most essential electronic devices.",
    "These are the objects I always have in my bag: my laptop, one notebook, three pens, my calculator, my earphones, and a water bottle. That yellow calculator is for Mathematics. Those earphones are from my brother Arman — they are very good quality. I also keep some healthy snacks in my bag because I get hungry between classes!"
  ],
